# Optional: copy to api.dev.env and merge with compose (see docker-compose.yml api-dev).
#
# Local Playwright support: docker-compose.yml sets
# API_DEV_E2E_TEST_ENDPOINTS_ENABLED=true by default on api-dev. Override to
# false in compose/.env if you want the dev API to hide /api/v1/auth/__test/*.
# Standalone `bun run dev` in api-template uses E2E_TEST_ENDPOINTS_ENABLED from
# api-template/.env.example (default false).
# JWT / CORS defaults are set in compose unless you override via compose/.env (API_DEV_*).
#
# Example extra API env (OAuth, email, etc.):
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
# RESEND_API_KEY=
